# rdofradio's options (rdofradio --help), for the rdofradio service. The settings are in /etc/rdofradio/config.json.
# A hotspot transmits: --allow-tx says so (without it rdofradio won't start).
# A hotspot board on the Pi's serial port, the web page on port 8080:
RDOF_ARGS="--allow-tx --mmdvm /dev/ttyAMA0 --web 0.0.0.0:8080"
# with an RTL-SDR too (and the libsoapysdr0.8 and soapysdr-module-rtlsdr packages):
#RDOF_ARGS="--allow-tx --mmdvm /dev/ttyAMA0 --soapy driver=rtlsdr --web 0.0.0.0:8080"
